Round 1 (about an hour) for a District by Zomato SDE-1 Backend role included a resume-based backend discussion after a DSA problem. The topics reported were:

- PostgreSQL indexes and when to use them; query optimisation and `EXPLAIN ANALYZE`;
- batching database queries;
- stateful vs stateless architecture;
- REST APIs and handling large responses;
- Kafka vs SQS; Kafka partitions, ordering and replayability;
- consumer idempotency;
- Prometheus/Grafana and high-cardinality labels.

The follow-ups were deep, asking what, why and how for everything the candidate had written on the resume.
